// RUN: %mojo_jupyter_executor %S/test_completion_incremental.ipynb | FileCheck %s

// Test that code completion works correctly across multiple evaluated cells,
// exercising the incremental completion cache. Definitions from earlier cells
// (Animal, Vehicle) must be visible in later completion requests.

// Check completions for Animal members (defined in cell 0, completed in cell 3).
// CHECK: completion: name
// CHECK: completion: legs

// Check completions for Vehicle members (defined in cell 2, completed in cell 4).
// CHECK: completion: make
// CHECK: completion: wheels
